  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MUTI-DONOR TRUST FUND - PSNP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Government of Ethiopia&#x2019;s Productive Safety Net Programme is the largest social protection programme in sub-Saharan Africa, supporting 7.9 million extremely poor and vulnerable people&#xA0;in drought-prone rural districts of Ethiopia since its inception in 2005. It contributes to a number of key Government policies and strategies within the framework of its current 10-year National Development Plan. Specific focus on reaching poor women-headed households and empowering women. Through the programme, beneficiaries receive cash and/or food transfers, are linked to a range of social services and receive livelihoods support. Community infrastructure is also rehabilitated through public works.</narrative>
  </description>
